    API -->|Auth & Rate Limit| Router[Storage Router]
    
    subgraph Control Plane
        Router -->|1. Lookup/Commit Metadata| MetaService[Metadata Service]
        MetaService -->|Read/Write| MetaDB[(Cassandra\nMetadata DB)]
    end
    
    subgraph Data Plane
        Router -->|2. Stream Data / Erasure Code| CS1[Chunk Server 1]
